Modifications by Redpill Linpro AB, 2026:

  - Rebuilt on Alfresco SDK 4.16.0 targeting Alfresco Content Services 26.1,
    replacing the Alfresco SDK 2.2.0 / ACS 5.1 build.
  - Migrated from AMP module layout to JAR module layout.
  - Migrated javax.mail and javax.activation to the jakarta.* namespace.
  - Moved Java sources out of the org.alfresco.slingshot package into
    com.redpill_linpro.alfresco.clipboard.
  - Moved Surf webscript packages and the Aikau service module out of the
    de.fmaul namespace.
  - Changed Maven coordinates from de.fmaul:alfresco-clipboard to
    com.redpill-linpro.alfresco:alfresco-clipboard.
